{
  "id": "about-honor",
  "text": "资质荣誉\n\n高新技术企业创新能力评价 AAAAA 级\n\n资质评级\n\n载人航天交会对接微波雷达研制突出贡献单位\n\n行业奖项\n\n陕西省著名商标\n\n品牌荣誉\n\nCMMI 成熟度 3 级认证\n\n体系认证\n\n2023 北京软件核心竞争力企业\n\n国家级资质\n\n2013中关村高成长企业 TOP100\n\n成长荣誉\n\n2012 中关村新锐企业十强\n\n成长荣誉\n\n北京市“创新型”中小企业\n\n资质认定",
  "html": "<div id=\"about-honor\" class=\"about-part scroll-mt-20\">\n        <div class=\"fade-in-up mb-10 lg:mb-12 max-w-2xl is-visible\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-mid mb-5\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900\">资质荣誉</h3>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 证书画廊（点击可放大） -->\n        <div id=\"honor-grid\" class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 md:gap-6\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-aaaaa-innovation.jpg\" data-title=\"高新技术企业创新能力评价 AAAAA 级\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-aaaaa-innovation.jpg\" alt=\"高新技术企业创新能力评价 AAAAA 级\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">高新技术企业创新能力评价 AAAAA 级</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-primary-light text-primary\">资质评级</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-space-rendezvous-radar.jpg\" data-title=\"载人航天交会对接微波雷达研制突出贡献单位\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-space-rendezvous-radar.jpg\" alt=\"载人航天交会对接微波雷达研制突出贡献单位\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">载人航天交会对接微波雷达研制突出贡献单位</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700\">行业奖项</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-shaanxi-trademark.jpg\" data-title=\"陕西省著名商标\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-shaanxi-trademark.jpg\" alt=\"陕西省著名商标\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">陕西省著名商标</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700\">品牌荣誉</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-cmmi3.jpg\" data-title=\"CMMI 成熟度 3 级认证\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-cmmi3.jpg\" alt=\"CMMI 成熟度 3 级认证\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">CMMI 成熟度 3 级认证</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-primary-light text-primary\">体系认证</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-bj-software-core.jpg\" data-title=\"2023 北京软件核心竞争力企业\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-bj-software-core.jpg\" alt=\"2023 北京软件核心竞争力企业\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">2023 北京软件核心竞争力企业</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-primary-light text-primary\">国家级资质</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-top100-2013.jpg\" data-title=\"2013中关村高成长企业 TOP100\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-top100-2013.jpg\" alt=\"2013中关村高成长企业 TOP100\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">2013中关村高成长企业 TOP100</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700\">成长荣誉</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-rising-2012.jpg\" data-title=\"2012 中关村新锐企业十强\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-rising-2012.jpg\" alt=\"2012 中关村新锐企业十强\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">2012 中关村新锐企业十强</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700\">成长荣誉</span>\n            </div></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-honor=\"images/honors/honor-innovative-sme.jpg\" data-title=\"北京市“创新型”中小企业\" class=\"fade-in-up is-visible group text-left\">\n            <div class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary-mid group-hover:shadow-card-hover hover-lift transition-all duration-200\">\n              <img src=\"images/honors/honor-innovative-sme.jpg\" alt=\"北京市“创新型”中小企业\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300\">\n              <span class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 w-7 h-7 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-white/90 text-gray-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M21 21l-4.3-4.3M11 8v6M8 11h6\"></path></svg></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2 min-h-[2.75rem]\">\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug line-clamp-2\">北京市“创新型”中小企业</p>\n              <span class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-xs bg-primary-light text-primary\">资质认定</span>\n            </div></button></div>\n      </div>",
